            <ArticleTitle>[About the correlation between bruxism and chronic headache].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>226-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>During a clinical investigation including 281 patients we analysed the association between bruxism and chronical benign headache. A correlations having practical relevance could be shown, especially for patients with headache similar in type to the classical tension headache.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
